   reTS\binaries\ts\cl_dlls\.

17. The buy menu shows the selected weapon's picture

   While the cursor is on a weapon in the buy menu's list, the box that shows its price (Credits) and
   slots (Slots) now also draws the weapon's sprites\weapons icon in its left half, where the original
   shows the gun image; the box drew the two numbers and no picture. It is the icon the bought-loadout
